  heading: "Commercial Stormwater & Runoff Management Systems"
  paragraphs:
    - >
      Unmanaged surface water runoff causes catastrophic soil erosion, foundation flooding, and asphalt pavement breakdown on commercial sites. S. Phaneuf & Associates designs and installs EPA-compliant commercial stormwater management systems across Massachusetts.
    - >
      We install precast concrete catch basins, heavy-duty storm sewer piping, underground Cultec recharge chambers, drywells, and retention swales.
    - >
      Our site grading crews direct surface water safely into underground drainage infrastructure, keeping commercial parking lots, driveways, and building sites dry and operational year-round.

